  "story": {
    "title": "The Rabbit who Became a Chef",
    "paragraphs_en": [
      "\"I eat only raw carrots everyday,\" said Rabbit to himself.",
      "\"I'm bored of eating raw carrots!\"",
      "\"What should I do to make these carrots tastier?\"",
      "One day, Rabbit went to a peasant's house and saw a pot boiling over heat.",
      "Right after he got an idea, the peasant's dog barked and chased him.",
      "\"Hmm,\" thought Rabbit. \"What should I do now?\"",
      "Rabbit tried to leave the carrots in the sun. But, the carrots were still raw like they were before.",
      "Then, he put them on fire. When he bit into them, those carrots tasted bitter!",
      "He thought and thought and thought about what should he do.",
      "﻿ Finally, he got an idea! First, he found an old tortoise shell.",
      "Then, he gathered some branches.",
      "﻿ And three stones.",
      "Yippee! Rabbit finally found a way to cook his carrots.",
      "﻿He was so happy that he invited his friends over.",
      "And they ate the yummy cooked carrots."
    ],
    "sentences": [
      {
        "text_en": "\"I eat only raw carrots everyday,\" said Rabbit to himself.",
        "paragraph_index": 0,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_140231/s_000.mp3",
        "text_vi": "\"Tôi chỉ ăn cà rốt sống mỗi ngày thôi,\" Thỏ tự nhủ."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "\"I'm bored of eating raw carrots!\"",
        "paragraph_index": 1,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_140231/s_001.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Mình chán ăn cà rốt sống lắm rồi!"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "\"What should I do to make these carrots tastier?\"",
        "paragraph_index": 2,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_140231/s_002.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Mình phải làm gì để cà rốt ngon hơn đây?"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "One day, Rabbit went to a peasant's house and saw a pot boiling over heat.",
        "paragraph_index": 3,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_140231/s_003.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Một ngày nọ, Thỏ đến nhà một người nông dân và thấy một cái nồi đang sôi trên bếp lửa."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Right after he got an idea, the peasant's dog barked and chased him.",
        "paragraph_index": 4,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_140231/s_004.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Ngay khi Thỏ vừa nghĩ ra một ý hay, con chó của người nông dân sủa và đuổi theo nó."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "\"Hmm,\" thought Rabbit.",
        "paragraph_index": 5,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_140231/s_005.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Hừm,"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "\"What should I do now?\"",
        "paragraph_index": 5,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_140231/s_006.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Bây giờ mình phải làm gì đây?"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Rabbit tried to leave the carrots in the sun.",
        "paragraph_index": 6,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_140231/s_007.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Thỏ thử phơi cà rốt dưới nắng."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "But, the carrots were still raw like they were before.",
        "paragraph_index": 6,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_140231/s_008.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Nhưng cà rốt vẫn còn sống y như cũ."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Then, he put them on fire.",
        "paragraph_index": 7,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_140231/s_009.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Sau đó, nó đặt cà rốt lên lửa."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "When he bit into them, those carrots tasted bitter!",
        "paragraph_index": 7,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_140231/s_010.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Khi nó cắn thử, những củ cà rốt đó có vị đắng ngắt!"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "He thought and thought and thought about what should he do.",
        "paragraph_index": 8,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_140231/s_011.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Nó cứ nghĩ mãi, nghĩ mãi xem mình nên làm gì."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "﻿ Finally, he got an idea!",
        "paragraph_index": 9,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_140231/s_012.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Cuối cùng, nó đã nghĩ ra một ý hay!"
      },
      {
        "text_en": "First, he found an old tortoise shell.",
        "paragraph_index": 9,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_140231/s_013.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Đầu tiên, nó tìm thấy một cái mai rùa cũ."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Then, he gathered some branches.",
        "paragraph_index": 10,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_140231/s_014.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Sau đó, nó gom một ít cành cây."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "﻿ And three stones.",
        "paragraph_index": 11,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_140231/s_015.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Và ba hòn đá."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "Yippee! Rabbit finally found a way to cook his carrots.",
        "paragraph_index": 12,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_140231/s_016.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Hoan hô! Cuối cùng Thỏ cũng tìm ra cách nấu cà rốt của mình."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "﻿He was so happy that he invited his friends over.",
        "paragraph_index": 13,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_140231/s_017.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Nó vui đến nỗi đã mời bạn bè đến chơi."
      },
      {
        "text_en": "And they ate the yummy cooked carrots.",
        "paragraph_index": 14,
        "audio_url": "https://audio.felixbuilderhub.com/books/book_140231/s_018.mp3",
        "text_vi": "Và chúng đã ăn những củ cà rốt nấu chín thật ngon lành."
      }
    ]
  },
